<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins mostly $1.00 higher; butts $1.00-2.00 higher; sknd. hams steady to $3.00 lower; sdls. bellies steady to $2.00 higher; trimmings generally steady.</p>
<p>Trading slow, with light demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
